{"id":"548dca61df509e98","group":"89","path":"89/89-thm-normalization.md","title":"Iterated Necessitation in a Normal Modal Logic","display":"thm-normalization — Iterated Necessitation in a Normal Modal Logic","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-thm-normalization","aliases":["89-thm-normalization"],"display":"thm-normalization — Iterated Necessitation in a Normal Modal Logic","depends_on":["[[89-df-normal-modal-logic]]","[[89-df-modal-iteration]]"],"revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-thm-normalization"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-thm-normalization</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-normalization — Iterated Necessitation in a Normal Modal Logic"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"bdef52f3ff411531\" href=\"?note=bdef52f3ff411531\" title=\"89-df-normal-modal-logic\">89-df-normal-modal-logic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e3dbb6a9ccbd6f00\" href=\"?note=e3dbb6a9ccbd6f00\" title=\"89-df-modal-iteration\">89-df-modal-iteration</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(L\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Normal}(L)\">\\(\\mathrm{Normal}(L)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box^n\">\\(\\Box^n\\)</span> 是含零次的句法迭代。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}normalization}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Normal}(L)\\Longrightarrow\n\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\n(A\\in L\\Longrightarrow\\Box^nA\\in L).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}normalization}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Normal}(L)\\Longrightarrow\n\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\n(A\\in L\\Longrightarrow\\Box^nA\\in L).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，印刷页 4、72；对应 PDF 页为印刷页加 39。</p>\n<p>固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in L\">\\(A\\in L\\)</span>，对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 归纳。零次为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>；若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box^n A\\in L\">\\(\\Box^n A\\in L\\)</span>，正规逻辑的必然化闭包给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box(\\Box^n A)\\in L\">\\(\\Box(\\Box^n A)\\in L\\)</span>，恰是下一次。文件名与 alias 保留，display 改为实际数学内容：这条性质是必然化的有限迭代，不是正规形化定理，也不主张 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\leftrightarrow\\Box A\">\\(A\\leftrightarrow\\Box A\\)</span>。迭代记号现在复用统一来源，免去各文件不同的局部定义。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-normal-modal-logic","status":"resolved","id":"bdef52f3ff411531","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-normal-modal-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-modal-iteration","status":"resolved","id":"e3dbb6a9ccbd6f00","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-iteration]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"L\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Normal}(L)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}normalization}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Normal}(L)\\Longrightarrow\n\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\n(A\\in L\\Longrightarrow\\Box^nA\\in L).","display":true},{"tex":"A\\in L","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box^n A\\in L","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box(\\Box^n A)\\in L","display":false},{"tex":"A\\leftrightarrow\\Box A","display":false}],"bytes":1198,"backlinks":[{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-484","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-thm-normalization]]"}],"outgoing":["bdef52f3ff411531","e3dbb6a9ccbd6f00"]}